{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>The steeds of the post-horses.</b> Of the king's acquisition, which have none like them." "<b>The aḥashteranim.</b> Some say: the mules." "<b>The ha-rammakhim.</b> They are the mares, and so in the language of Ishmael, for most of its structure follows the way of the holy tongue, and the offspring of mares are stronger than the offspring of donkeys."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:15.336072016Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}